3. Google Maps: live distance and location
Setup
Create a project in Google Cloud Console and enable billing. Google gives a monthly free credit, but billing must be on.
Enable these APIs: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API.
Create two keys:
Browser key (NEXT_PUBLIC_GMAPS_KEY): restrict by HTTP referrer to your domain, and by API to Maps JS and Places only.
Server key (GMAPS_SERVER_KEY): restrict by IP or leave to server only, and by API to Routes only.
Set a daily quota cap and budget alert so a bot cannot run up a bill.
